      <div style="margin-top:6pt;margin-left:69.66pt;width:456pt;">
        <div style="text-indent:20pt; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">The chairperson and members of the four standing committees of the Board are generally entitled to the following annual cash retainers: </font>
