          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">The dollar amounts reported in this column are the amounts of total compensation reported for our PEO for each corresponding year in the &#8220;Total&#8221; column of the Summary Compensation Table. Refer to &#8220;Executive Compensation&#8201;&#8212;&#8201;Summary Compensation Table.&#8221; </font>
        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
        <div style=" float:left; line-height:12pt; margin-top:3.7pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:left; width:20pt;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:normal;font-size:10pt;">
