      </div>
      <div style="margin-top:6pt;margin-bottom:522pt;margin-left:69.66pt;width:456pt;">
        <div style="text-indent:20pt; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:-0.2pt;">In Witness Whereof</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">, </font><font style="font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:-0.2pt;">Outlook Therapeutics, Inc.</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> has caused this Certificate of Amendment to be signed by its Chief Financial Officer, Treasurer and Secretary this &#8199;&#8199;&#8199;&#8199;&#8199;&#8199;&#8199;&#8199; &#8199;&#8199;day of &#8199;&#8199;&#8199;&#8199;&#8199;&#8199;&#8199;&#8199; &#8199;&#8199;, 2024. </font>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-left:240pt; margin-top:8pt; width:216pt; line-height:12pt;font-weight:bold;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:-0.2pt;">Outlook Therapeutics, Inc.</font><font style="font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
